          </p>
          <div className="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-line">
            <h3 className="font-semibold text-dtext mb-2">
              Resolution Rate
            </p>
            <p className="text-2xl font-bold text-dtext">
              {data?.resolution_rate || 0}%
            </p>
            <p className="text-sm text-muted">
              {data?.resolution_rate_change || 0}% vs previous period
